vrnetlab's licence, for the vrnetlab code in this directory

launch.py.upstream-plus-numnics and launch.py.patched are copies of vrnetlab's
dell/dell_sonic/docker/launch.py, and patch_launch.py keeps some of that file's lines in the
methods it writes. vrnetlab is https://github.com/srl-labs/vrnetlab; the copies come from commit
3a34fa63d73843c871f248e2df2ffa5c038183ce. Its LICENSE file at that commit follows unchanged,
between the two rules.

